ot had many errors (perhaps 3% of files uploading would fail). \n\nHowever, I've killed rclone syncs at various times over the last week for various reasons. However, now it appears all the files (they're starting to be the larger files as well) are beginning to not only transfer, but also receive the 504 error. Every now and again one of the files transfers without error, but I nearly will have a 1 to 1 match of files transferred to errors. All the errors are the `504 GATEWAY_TIMEOUT` errors.\n\nIs there something that is causing this or that I can do to avert this? Thanks\n","closed_by":{"login":"taylorwmj","id":11332705,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzMyNzA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11332705?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorwmj","html_url":"https://github.com/taylorwmj","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorwmj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorwmj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorwmj/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorwmj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorwmj/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorwmj/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorwmj/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorwmj/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taylorwmj/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/606/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/606/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}